    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 92.6,
      "end": 98.82,
      "en": "So now we've looked at our two vocabulary preview words for this dialogue and we are ready to listen to it for the first time.",
      "zh": "所以现在我们已经看到了我们的两个词汇预览词来进行这次对话，我们准备第一次听它。"
    },
    {
