    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 347.0,
      "end": 347.18,
      "en": "Coincidence.",
      "zh": "巧合。"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 348.34,
      "end": 353.4,
      "en": "So, again, we have some great examples for you to understand how we use coincidence.",
      "zh": "所以，我们有一些很好的例子供您了解我们如何使用巧合。"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "start": 355.34,
      "end": 355.6,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "start": 358.42,
      "end": 359.57,
      "en": "I'm going to New York this weekend.",
      "zh": "这个周末我要去纽约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "start": 360.66,
      "end": 365.54,
      "en": "What a coincidence, I am too.",
      "zh": "真巧，我也是。"
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "start": 365.54,
      "end": 365.76,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "start": 368.74,
      "end": 371.75,
      "en": "By coincidence, everyone in the room was named Alex.",
      "zh": "巧合的是，屋子里每个人都叫 Alex。"
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "start": 376.58,
      "end": 380.46,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "start": 380.46,
      "end": 382.0,
      "en": "We met by pure coincidence.",
      "zh": "我们相遇纯属巧合。"
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "start": 382.78,
      "end": 385.98,
      "en": "One day we ran into each other on our bikes and we've been together ever since.",
      "zh": "有一天，我们骑着自行车碰到了对方，从那以后我们就一直在一起。"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 389.26,
      "end": 392.13,
      "en": "A coincidence is something that happens by chance, right?",
      "zh": "巧合是偶然发生的事情，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "start": 392.43,
      "end": 394.07,
      "en": "Right, you didn't plan it, it just happened.",
      "zh": "对了，你没有计划，它只是发生了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "start": 394.35,
      "end": 396.59,
      "en": "Yeah, these funny little things happen all the time.",
      "zh": "是的，这些有趣的小事一直在发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "start": 396.59,
      "end": 399.37,
      "en": "I love it when these coincidences happen.",
      "zh": "当这些巧合发生时，我喜欢它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "start": 400.05,
      "end": 401.23,
      "en": "Yeah, they're great.",
      "zh": "是的，他们很棒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "start": 401.49,
      "end": 405.45,
      "en": "So Erica, why don't you tell us about a coincidence that's happened to you?",
      "zh": "所以埃里卡，你为什么不告诉我们发生在你身上的巧合？"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "start": 405.87,
      "end": 415.11,
      "en": "Well, the other night I was having dinner in a restaurant and I looked up and I saw my old professor from university.",
      "zh": "好吧，那天晚上我在一家餐馆吃晚饭，我抬起头，看到了我大学的老教授。"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "start": 416.15,
      "end": 423.87,
      "en": "It was such a coincidence because here we are in Shanghai and I see my professor from Canada having dinner at the table next to me.",
      "zh": "这是一个巧合，因为我们在上海，我看到我的加拿大教授在我旁边的餐桌上吃饭。"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 423.93,
      "end": 425.13,
      "en": "It was such a coincidence.",
      "zh": "真是太巧了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 425.29,
      "end": 426.13,
      "en": "That is a coincidence.",
      "zh": "真是巧啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 426.5,
      "end": 427.5,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "start": 427.5,
      "end": 432.14,
      "en": "Or has it ever happened to you that you're thinking of someone and that person calls you?",
      "zh": "或者你有没有想过你在想某人而那个人给你打电话？"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 432.14,
      "end": 433.5,
      "en": "That happens all the time.",
      "zh": "这一直在发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 433.5,
      "end": 433.89,
      "en": "That's a coincidence.",
      "zh": "确实很巧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 434.5,
      "end": 435.5,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 435.63,
      "end": 445.16,
      "en": "Okay, so now that we have learned these three language takeaway words, we can listen to our dialogue a second time but this time it's going to be slower.",
      "zh": "好的，现在我们已经学会了这三种语言要点词，我们可以第二次听我们的对话，但这次会更慢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "start": 449.28,
      "end": 451.76,
      "en": "Hey, watch where you're going.",
      "zh": "嘿，看着点路！"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 452.44,
      "end": 454.28,
      "en": "Oh no, I'm so sorry.",
      "zh": "天哪，真对不起。"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 454.9,
      "end": 455.76,
      "en": "Are you all right?",
      "zh": "你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "start": 456.32,
      "end": 458.18,
      "en": "Oh, I don't know.",
      "zh": "哦，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 458.86,
      "end": 460.28,
      "en": "I feel terrible.",
      "zh": "我感觉很糟。"
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "start": 461.2,
      "end": 462.78,
      "en": "I didn't mean to knock you over.",
      "zh": "我不是故意把你打倒的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "start": 463.48,
      "end": 466.58,
      "en": "My tire just exploded and I lost control of my bike.",
      "zh": "我刚才爆胎了，自行车失去了控制。"
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 467.24,
      "end": 469.0,
      "en": "Really, it was an accident.",
      "zh": "真的，这是一个意外。"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 469.78,
      "end": 470.9,
      "en": "Please accept my apologies.",
      "zh": "请接受我的道歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 471.85,
      "end": 473.81,
      "en": "Just let me try to stand up.",
      "zh": "先让我试着站起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 474.47,
      "end": 476.05,
      "en": "Oh, wait a second.",
      "zh": "哦，等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 476.68,
      "end": 478.52,
      "en": "You seem really familiar.",
      "zh": "你好像很面熟。"
    },
