      "start": 479.36,
      "end": 481.7,
      "en": "I think I know you from somewhere.",
      "zh": "我好像在哪儿见过你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 482.28,
      "end": 485.64,
      "en": "Yeah, I think we have met somewhere before.",
      "zh": "是的，我想我们以前在某个地方见过面。"
    },
