      "id": 157,
      "start": 490.78,
      "end": 491.4,
      "en": "What a coincidence.",
      "zh": "真巧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 158,
      "start": 492.65,
      "end": 497.51,
      "en": "But anyway, I'm glad to see that you're not badly hurt and I should probably get going.",
      "zh": "但不管怎么说，看到你没受重伤我就放心了，我该走了。"
    },
