      "id": 165,
      "start": 514.43,
      "end": 516.01,
      "en": "Are you calling an ambulance?",
      "zh": "你在叫救护车吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "start": 516.77,
      "end": 521.47,
      "en": "No, I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.",
      "zh": "不，我要取消我的会，好留下来陪你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 167,
      "start": 527.56,
      "end": 529.48,
      "en": "Well, that was much clearer, wasn't it?",
      "zh": "嗯，这更清楚了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 168,
      "start": 529.98,
      "end": 531.7,
      "en": "Yes, that was clear.",
      "zh": "是的，这很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 169,
      "start": 531.7,
      "end": 533.46,
      "en": "And this brings us to Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "这将我们带到了流利表达。"
    },
