      "id": 170,
      "start": 535.5,
      "end": 535.76,
      "en": "Fluency Builder.",
      "zh": "流利表达。"
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "start": 536.9,
      "end": 540.92,
      "en": "In today's Fluency Builder, we're going to show you different ways of apologizing.",
      "zh": "在今天的流利表达中，我们将向您展示不同的道歉方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 172,
      "start": 542.14,
      "end": 547.1,
      "en": "It's so important to be able to apologize well and fluently.",
      "zh": "能够流利地道歉非常重要。"
    },
