      "id": 173,
      "start": 547.54,
      "end": 548.02,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 174,
      "start": 548.44,
      "end": 551.02,
      "en": "And you also want to say something different from I'm sorry.",
      "zh": "而且你也想换一种说法，而不是总说 I'm sorry。"
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 551.56,
      "end": 551.74,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 176,
      "start": 552.28,
      "end": 553.76,
      "en": "So that's what we're going to show you today.",
      "zh": "这就是我们今天要向您展示的内容。"
