      "start": 703.73,
      "end": 707.15,
      "en": "But anyway, I'm glad to see you're not badly hurt, and I should probably get going.",
      "zh": "但不管怎样，看到你没受重伤我就放心了，我该走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 707.44,
      "end": 710.2,
      "en": "I've got a nine o'clock meeting.",
      "zh": "我九点还有个会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 710.2,
      "end": 710.63,
      "en": "But here's my number.",
      "zh": "不过这是我的号码。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 711.2,
      "end": 712.53,
      "en": "Call me and we'll exchange insurance information.",
      "zh": "打电话给我，我们将交换保险信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 713.16,
      "end": 714.16,
      "en": "Ouch!",
      "zh": "哎哟!"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 714.16,
      "end": 714.49,
      "en": "My ankle!",
      "zh": "我的脚踝！"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 715.16,
      "end": 715.65,
      "en": "I think it's broken.",
      "zh": "我觉得脚踝骨折了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 716.48,
      "end": 717.71,
      "en": "You can't just leave me like this!",
      "zh": "你不能就这样离开我！"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 724.36,
      "end": 725.15,
      "en": "Are you calling an ambulance?",
      "zh": "你在叫救护车吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 726.04,
      "end": 726.35,
      "en": "Nope.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 726.81,
      "end": 729.23,
      "en": "I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.",
      "zh": "我要取消我的会，好留下来陪你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 753.21,
      "end": 755.45,
      "en": "Great dialogue and great music, right?",
      "zh": "伟大的对话和伟大的音乐，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 756.44,
      "end": 757.44,
      "en": "Awful music.",
      "zh": "可怕的音乐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 757.44,
      "end": 758.44,
      "en": "Who picked that, Marco?",
      "zh": "谁选的，马可？"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 758.44,
      "end": 759.15,
      "en": "Of course, me.",
      "zh": "当然是我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 759.89,
      "end": 760.85,
      "en": "I'm a romantic type.",
      "zh": "我是一个浪漫的类型。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 761.05,
      "end": 762.03,
      "en": "I love romantic music.",
      "zh": "我喜欢浪漫的音乐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 762.25,
      "end": 762.39,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 762.95,
      "end": 763.29,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 763.91,
      "end": 769.15,
      "en": "Well, speaking of a romantic type, do you believe in love at first sight?",
      "zh": "好吧，说到浪漫的类型，你相信一见钟情吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 770.4,
      "end": 771.66,
      "en": "I kind of do.",
      "zh": "我算是相信吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 771.88,
      "end": 772.88,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 772.88,
      "end": 773.26,
      "en": "I'd like to believe it.",
      "zh": "我愿意相信。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 773.88,
      "end": 774.88,
      "en": "Yeah, well...",
      "zh": "是的，嗯..."
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 774.88,
      "end": 775.44,
      "en": "That surprises me.",
      "zh": "这让我感到惊讶。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 776.72,
      "end": 782.16,
      "en": "Well, I think the first time that you see someone, it impresses you some way, and you feel attracted to that person.",
      "zh": "好吧，我想当你第一次见到某人时，它会给你留下深刻的印象，你会被那个人所吸引。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 782.42,
      "end": 782.68,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 783.26,
      "end": 783.52,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 784.72,
      "end": 789.84,
      "en": "What is the first feeling that you get that makes you want to talk to that person or get to know that person?",
      "zh": "你得到的第一感觉是什么让你想和那个人交谈或认识那个人？"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 789.84,
      "end": 790.94,
      "en": "I am the exact opposite.",
      "zh": "我正好相反。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 791.43,
      "end": 791.87,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 792.64,
      "end": 798.24,
      "en": "When I see somebody for the first time, my first impression is, oh, it's wrong.",
      "zh": "我第一次见到某人时，第一印象总是：哦，不对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 798.24,
      "end": 803.76,
      "en": "So if I see someone and I like them at the beginning, in three weeks I'll hate them.",
      "zh": "所以如果我一开始就看到某人并且我喜欢他们，三周后我会讨厌他们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 803.76,
      "end": 807.94,
      "en": "And if I see someone and I don't like them when I first meet them, I'll be their best friend.",
      "zh": "如果我在第一次见到他们时看到某人并且我不喜欢他们，我将成为他们最好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 808.38,
      "end": 808.88,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 809.8,
      "end": 811.6,
      "en": "So love at first sight doesn't work for me.",
      "zh": "所以一见钟情对我不起作用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 811.6,
      "end": 814.06,
      "en": "I'm sure that our listeners have some stories that love at first sight.",
      "zh": "我敢肯定，我们的听众有一些一见钟情的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 814.4,
      "end": 817.02,
      "en": "Maybe they've met their wives or their boyfriends in this way.",
      "zh": "也许他们以这种方式认识了他们的妻子或男朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 817.92,
      "end": 818.67,
      "en": "I'd like to hear about it.",
      "zh": "我想听听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 819.04,
      "end": 819.35,
      "en": "Me too.",
      "zh": "我也是。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 820.12,
      "end": 825.23,
      "en": "And if anybody knows the name of the songs we used, also be sure to post it on the discussion board.",
      "zh": "如果有人知道我们使用的歌曲的名称，也一定要把它贴在讨论板上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 826.12,
      "end": 827.12,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 827.12,
      "end": 827.55,
      "en": "Our challenge for this week.",
      "zh": "我们本周的挑战。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 828.12,
      "end": 829.27,
      "en": "Our challenge for this lesson.",
      "zh": "这就是本课的挑战。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 829.68,
      "end": 830.68,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 830.68,
      "end": 840.89,
      "en": "So that's all for today, everyone, but be sure to go to our website at EnglishPod.com and as we said, leave all your comments, your stories, and see if you know the name of the songs.",
      "zh": "所以这就是今天的全部内容，每个人，但请务必访问我们的网站 englishpod.com，正如我们所说，留下您的所有评论、故事，看看您是否知道歌曲的名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 841.96,
      "end": 844.96,
      "en": "Okay, well, thanks for listening, everyone, and until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "好的，谢谢大家的收听，直到下一次，再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 844.96,
      "end": 845.96,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 845.96,
      "end": 853.943,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
